name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q13_2025'

question 'Which of the following is an edge case test for a loop that processes a list of student grades?'

wrong 'A list with 5 students who all have the same grade.'
wrong 'A list where students are sorted alphabetically.'
wrong 'A list containing 25 students with average grades.'
right 'A list that is completely empty (0 students).'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 10

Edge cases involve testing the boundaries of logic, such as an empty list or a list with only one item, to ensure the app doesn't crash in unusual situations.
MARKDOWN
